    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to wishlist Hell Architect</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Homer\u2019s Odyssey is an <strong>interactive narrative game</strong> inspired by one of the classic ancient Greek epic poems written by Homer, <strong>mixing gameplay elements from adventure and card game genres</strong>.<br><br><strong>A timeless classic suitable for everyone</strong>, telling the tale of \u201cOdysseus the Cunning\u201d- mastermind behind the Trojan Horse- and his 10-year struggle to return home after the end of the war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RELIVE THE MYTH: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Experience <strong>more than 10 hours</strong> of the classic adventure through interactive illustrations, narration, dialogues, music, exploration, voice acting, puzzles and card game duels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT YOUR ENEMIES: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Collect cards</strong>, upgrade them and choose your deck to <strong>challenge the AI in intense duels</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE THE PROTAGONIST: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take on the role of Odysseus, relive the intellectual duels against his enemies and experience unique <strong>story-driven card game boss battles</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE, LEARN, AND PLAY: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Delve deeper into the lore, <strong>interact with objects, illustrations, characters</strong> and uncover famous myths as you sail the waters of the Mediterranean Sea.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRUE TO THE ORIGINAL: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/601862228654a51cc267ee7080b50314.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/601862228654a51cc267ee7080b50314.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/601862228654a51cc267ee7080b50314.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Learn the story of the Odyssey as it was meant to be told through an adaptation that stays <strong>true to the original texts</strong> in order to maintain the authenticity of this timeless epic tale.",
    "about_the_game": "Homer\u2019s Odyssey is an <strong>interactive narrative game</strong> inspired by one of the classic ancient Greek epic poems written by Homer, <strong>mixing gameplay elements from adventure and card game genres</strong>.<br><br><strong>A timeless classic suitable for everyone</strong>, telling the tale of \u201cOdysseus the Cunning\u201d- mastermind behind the Trojan Horse- and his 10-year struggle to return home after the end of the war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RELIVE THE MYTH: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/3977784938aef179c74fe0d4eff7f3a1.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Experience <strong>more than 10 hours</strong> of the classic adventure through interactive illustrations, narration, dialogues, music, exploration, voice acting, puzzles and card game duels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT YOUR ENEMIES: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/1dc0d73193f4abe65ce84c9b2ade3c94.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Collect cards</strong>, upgrade them and choose your deck to <strong>challenge the AI in intense duels</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE THE PROTAGONIST: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/6d4a3b504a3779c5479bb85e209c1f68.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take on the role of Odysseus, relive the intellectual duels against his enemies and experience unique <strong>story-driven card game boss battles</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE, LEARN, AND PLAY: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.webm?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/5ad62565715324cbe54bffce1986c23b.mp4?t=1655736820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Delve deeper into the lore, <strong>interact with objects, illustrations, characters</strong> and uncover famous myths as you sail the waters of the Mediterranean Sea.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRUE TO THE ORIGINAL: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165660/extras/601862228654a51cc267ee7080b50314.poster.avif?t=1655736820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.